'),(30756,22,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Visit HERMON Group, S.A in Maputo (Av. Vladmir Lenine, Millenium Park Building) or Beira (ADIL Stores building). Call +258 86 572 4000 or write to info@hermongroup.co.mz.'),(30757,24,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Business Consulting Services | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30758,24,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Commercial representation, partner & client identification, company matchmaking, business preparation, expansion & growth strategy and investment & grants facilitation in Mozambique.'),(30759,26,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Our History Since 2008 | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30760,26,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','From HERMON Multi Services, E.I in 2008 to HERMON Group, S.A: the story of a Mozambican group in ICT, shipping, marine operations, logistics and business consulting.'),(30761,28,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Group Companies | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30762,28,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Meet the HERMON Group companies: HERMON Logistics (logistics & supply chain), HERMON Mozambique (EPC & services), HERMON Consulting and BUCA Holdings (general trading).'),(30763,30,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Media | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30764,30,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Photos and updates from HERMON Group, S.A projects and operations across Mozambique. Follow us on Instagram, Facebook and LinkedIn.'),(30765,32,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Contact Us | HERMON Group, S.A – Maputo & Beira'),(30766,32,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Contact HERMON Group, S.A: info@hermongroup.co.mz, commercial@hermongroup.co.mz, +258 86 572 4000 / +258 84 421 7130. Offices in Maputo and Beira, Mozambique.'),(30767,386,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Key Personnel | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30768,386,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Meet the leadership of HERMON Group, S.A, led by Executive Founder Mr. Joseph Fundice, and see the group organization chart.'),(30769,4031,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Our Strategy | HERMON Group, S.A'),(30770,4031,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Operational excellence, adaptability to global change and strong supplier and custome