581,14.497-26.093,29.078-29.079v29.079 H331.757z M360.835,316.546c-22.866,3.297-40.993,21.424-44.29,44.29H68.454c-3.297-22.866-21.425-40.994-44.29-44.29v-50.381 h110.433v68.434h115.805v-68.434h110.433V316.546z\"></path> <path d=\"M221.765,267.022h-58.53v38.938h58.53V267.022z M206.765,290.96h-28.53v-8.938h28.53V290.96z\"></path> <rect x=\"163.235\" y=\"213.007\" width=\"58.53\" height=\"15\"></rect> </g> </g></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Investment & Grants Facilitation						\n					</h3>','Our Services','','publish','closed','closed','','our-services','','','2025-06-24 12:36:39','2025-06-24 12:36:39','',0,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/?page_id=24',0,'page','',0),(26,1,'2025-06-15 08:08:00','2025-06-15 08:08:00','<h2> Background &amp; Development – It’s Foundation Roots</h2>				\n		<h6><strong>July, 2008</strong></h6><p>HERMON Multi Services, E.I was registered by the first time.</p><h6><strong>August, 2008 – July, 2010</strong></h6><p>A supply chain and service contract were awarded to HERMON Multi Services, E.I by the Government to assist all government institutions within Central &amp; North of Sofala &amp; South of Zambézia Provinces in ICT Management. Providing Trainings in Computer Literacy (Microsoft Office Packages) and Accounts to the people living in the same areas.</p><h6><strong>August 2010 – July, 2016</strong></h6><p>HERMON Multi Services, E.I was awarded some contracts in the shipping and Marine Industry (Freight Forwarding – Imports, Exports and Customs Clearing) and Marine Operations, such as Crew Change and Fender Care.</p><ul><li>Acting as AGENT – Shipper’s representative in Mozambique by providing with the Ocean, and Road freight services to the customers into hinterland, who were importing and exporting their goods from and to Beira Port, with clearance processes, cargo expedition, and Bill of Ladings processing at the Shipping Lines on behalf of the Shippers, Notifying Parties, and the Consignees.</li></ul><ul><li>Assisting vessels alongside of the sea at Beira Port with fendering operations and crew movement (from vessels to the hotels, from hotels to the airport, and vice-versa).</li></ul><h6><strong>August 2016 – November, 2019</strong></h6><p>HERMON Multi Services, E.I was part of Open Cast Mining operations at the Balama Graphite Mine, Benga Coal Mine Operations, where Civil Construction, Bulk Earthwork (Bush Clearing), Drill &amp; Blast, Mine Planning and Operations Management, ROM feeding and Blending, Roads Construction and Maintenance) was the core business.</p><p>01 | Mining Operations – Contracted by TAYANNA, under SYRAH Resources, S.A</p><p>       Balama Graphite Project - Period of Contract: 3.5 Years.</p><p>1.1 – Main Job purpose:</p><ol><li>a) Manpower Supply and operations management;</li><li>b) Open Cast Mining Contract management;</li><li>c) Plant ROM feed and blending;</li><li>d) Ore sampling;</li><li>e) Bulk Earthworks, load &amp; haul for TSF dam construction;</li><li>f) Survey Work;</li></ol><p>1.2 – Contract Value:  US$165,000 on monthly basis.</p><p>1.3 - <strong>Syrah Resources - Raw Water Pipe Line Award</strong> of a 15km pipeline linking raw water dam to the processing plant.</p><p>HDPE pipes 225 OD PN10 - 1.2km</p><p>HDPE pipes 315 OD PN10 - 4.4km</p><p>HDPE pipes 315 OD PN 12.5 - 2.7km</p><p>HDPE pipes 315 OD PN 16 - 1.8km</p><p>HDPE pipes 315 OD PN 20 - 3.7km</p><p>HDPE pipes 315 OD PN 25 - 1.6km</p><p>Total Length 15.4km  </p><p>4.2.1. Installation of submersible raw water supply pumps x 2no</p><p>4.2.2 Installation and erection of raw water transfer tanks x 1no  </p><p>4.2.3 Installation of 50mm2- 33KV electrical supply cable including trefoil strapping;</p><p>4.2.4 Installation of 12 core single mode fiber optic cable Contract</p><p>Value: US$ 110,000 On monthly basis</p><p>Duration: <strong>5 months</strong></p><p>1.4 – <strong>Mustang Resources, S.A</strong> – On the Montepuez Ruby Green Fields Project  open cast contract mining.</p><p>Main Job purpose:</p><ol><li>Manpower Supply and Management;</li><li>PIT Operations;</li><li>Plant ROM feeding Operations;</li><li>Road works.</li></ol><p>Value: US$ 85,000 on monthly basis</p><p>Duration: <strong>18 months</strong></p><p>1.5 – <strong>Battery Minerals, S.A</strong> – Bulk sample extraction Phase # 1 of graphite reserve on remote site in the Cabo Delgado Province.</p><ol><li>Access road upgrade;</li><li>Internal mining road establishments;</li><li>Bush clearing;</li><li>Overburden removal;</li><li>Ore extraction;</li><li>Transport of ore from remote site to crushing plant - 260km;</li><li>Crushing and screening;</li></ol><p>Life of Mine: 10years</p><p>Current Contract Value: US$+/- $250,000.00</p><h6><strong>By the end of November, 2019</strong></h6><p>HERMON Multi Services, E.I was undertaken by shareholders and ended up changing the name into <strong>HERMON Group, S.A</strong> and gradually, the subsidiary companies were generated from the mother company, so…</p><p>Explore More HERMON Group’s Business Units by clicking the provided Links…</p><p>We hereby to state that in this document, we set out information about HERMON Group’s Background and Development, our relevant experience, our intended approach to this engagement and the people that would be involved. We have limited this document to information that we believe is relevant to your business. Thanks.</p>		\n					<h2>Our Personnel Structure</h2>				\n		<p>HERMON Group, S.A has a total of 10 permanent employees, excluding outsourced employees. Its team is comprised of dedicated employees who go extra mile to ensure 100% client’s satisfaction.</p><p>In fact, of being privately owned by shareholders is also a professionally managed company and each division is staffed by a competent, professional, qualified multilingual experts from various backgrounds under the leadership of the Group Directors with a solid track record in achieving optimal results by meeting client expectations as per the group internal policies.</p><p>We are able to provide a level of personalized services which is unrivalled by many of our competitors – and that means you’re more likely to find us efficient, friendly, honest and, above all, able to provide you with exactly what you need.</p><p>At <strong>HERMON Group, S.A</strong>, we passionately believe that every company has different needs. We therefore treat each customer on an individual basis, with the overall objective of adding value to their business.</p><p>Our ambition is to be the best in our actuation fields;</p><p>Our aim is simply to ensure that our clients find the role they want.</p><p>To achieve it, we take deep-rooted of our market and add up-to date technology and professional training and apply them to the fundamental values of hard work, thoroughness and honesty.</p><p>In this document, we set out information about our company, our relevant experience is on our Skilled Members, our intended approach to this engagement and the people that would be involved.</p><p>Our Directors, our Managers and Technical team have over 15 years of experience in Mining Operations, Geological Studies, Human Resources, Accounting &amp; Auditing, Training and Development, Supply Chain Management, Shipping / Maritime Operations – Imports &amp; Exports, Transport &amp; Logistics, Pipeline Solutions, and other related fields.</p><p>We have a strong branch network and support throughout Mozambique and the different business units pull together to ensure efficiency and timely service delivery.</p>		\n					<h2>Our Strategy</h2>				\n							<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>						\n										Our strategy is built on the foundation of our company values and will drive our successful development in order to achieve our vision by.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>						\n										Continuously simplifying our processes and increasing our operational excellence, exceeding customer expectations.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>						\n										Adapting towards the constant global changes and demand by planning for the unexpected, learning from each experience.\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8C119 8 8 119 8 256s111 248 248 248 248-111 248-248S393 8 256 8z\"></path></svg>						\n										Consolidating the relationship with our suppliers and customers by maintaining consistency, allowing more people to rely on our services, facilitating our expansion throughout the Southern Africa region.\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n					<h2>Our Strategic Partners</h2>				\n								<figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Synergetic.png\" alt=\"Synergetic\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Sahara.png\" alt=\"Sahara\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/MFT.png\" alt=\"MFT\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/7-4.png\" alt=\"7-4.png\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/8-4.png\" alt=\"8-4.png\" /></figure><figure><img data-src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/CenterWay.jpg\" alt=\"CenterWay\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 