aceholder-35.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(386,1,'2025-06-16 13:56:40','2025-06-16 13:56:40','<h2>Our Key Personnel</h2>				\n		<p>Mr. Joseph Fundice is the <strong>HERMON Group’s Executive Founder</strong>, holding a Degree in Business Administration and Human Resources Management, with a vast experience in business and HR management including logistics. He has a strong leadership skills, he is responsible for the Group business development within southern Africa region, and additionally, he has undertaken the commercial relations with clients and other business partners. Together with his team, Joseph will continue to create strategies which will position HERMON Logistics, Lda as a major company in the Logistics sector.</p>		\n					<h2>Organization Chart</h2>				\n															<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1055\" src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-scaled.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-scaled.png 2560w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-300x124.png 300w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-1024x422.png 1024w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-768x316.png 768w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-1536x633.png 1536w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Organization-Chart-2048x844.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" />','Key Personnel','','publish','closed','closed','','key-personnel','','','2025-07-17 22:48:42','2025-07-17 22:48:42','',0,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/?page_id=386',0,'page','',0),(389,1,'2025-07-23 01:13:07','2025-06-16 13:57:09',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','389','','','2025-07-23 01:13:07','2025-07-23 01:13:07','',0,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/?p=389',5,'nav_menu_item','',0),(408,1,'2025-06-16 14:06:56','2025-06-16 14:06:56','','placeholder.png','