25/06/Our-strategy-768x575.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px\" />															\n		<p>Our strategy is built on the foundation of our company values and will drive our successful development in order to achieve our vision by.</p>		\n															<img width=\"1036\" height=\"776\" src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuously-simplifying.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuously-simplifying.png 1036w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuously-simplifying-300x225.png 300w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuously-simplifying-1024x767.png 1024w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Continuously-simplifying-768x575.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px\" />															\n		<p>Continuously simplifying our processes and increasing our operational excellence, exceeding customer expectations.</p>		\n															<img width=\"1036\" height=\"776\" src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Adapting-towards.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Adapting-towards.png 1036w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Adapting-towards-300x225.png 300w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Adapting-towards-1024x767.png 1024w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Adapting-towards-768x575.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px\" />															\n		<p>Adapting towards the constant global changes and demand by planning for the unexpected, learning from each experience.</p>		\n															<img width=\"1036\" height=\"776\" src=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Consolidating-the-relationship.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Consolidating-the-relationship.png 1036w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Consolidating-the-relationship-300x225.png 300w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Consolidating-the-relationship-1024x767.png 1024w, https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Consolidating-the-relationship-768x575.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1036px) 100vw, 1036px\" />															\n		<p>Consolidating the relationship with our suppliers and customers by maintaining consistency, allowing more people to rely on our services, facilitating our expansion throughout the Southern Africa region.</p>','Our Strategy','','publish','closed','closed','','our-strategy','','','2025-07-19 11:11:55','2025-07-19 11:11:55','',0,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/?elementor_library=our-strategy',0,'elementor_library','',0),(1530,1,'2025-07-19 12:04:09','2025-07-19 12:04:09','','Teste 1','','inherit','open','closed','','teste-1-2','','','2025-07-19 12:04:09','2025-07-19 12:04:09','',26,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Teste-1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1532,1,'2025-07-19 12:09:27','2025-07-19 12:09:27','','4','','inherit','open','closed','','4','','','2025-07-19 12:09:27','2025-07-19 12:09:27','',26,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/4.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1533,1,'2025-07-19 12:09:27','2025-07-19 12:09:27','','5','','inherit','open','closed','','5','','','2025-07-19 12:09:27','2025-07-19 12:09:27','',26,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/5.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1534,1,'2025-07-19 12:09:28','2025-07-19 12:09:28','','6','','inherit','open','closed','','6','','','2025-07-19 12:09:28','2025-07-19 12:09:28','',26,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/6.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1535,1,'2025-07-19 12:09:28','2025-07-19 12:09:28','','1','','inherit','open','closed','','1','','','2025-07-19 12:09:28','2025-07-19 12:09:28','',26,'https://hermongroup.co.mz/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1536,1,'2025-07-19 12:09:29','2025-07-19 12:0